      [
        "Performance Features",
        "1. Large‑diameter impeller delivers strong mixing capacity for pulp and reagents.\n2. High impeller peripheral speed enhances mixing performance for pulp and reagents.\n3. Down‑swept impeller further strengthens mixing of pulp and reagents.\n4. Improved agitation capacity brings better pulp‑reagent circulation performance.\n5. A guide body is installed inside the tank to generate relatively high negative pressure within limited space and boost suction capacity. The down‑swept impeller produces downward operating pressure to improve suction and circulation capacity. A jet component is fitted at the lower part of the guide body for further enhanced pulp‑reagent circulation. It achieves 100% reagent coating on mineral surfaces for superior processing indexes.",
